flowchart LR
    A(Driver Enable) --> B{Robot::Init}
    subgraph init
        B --> Log(Setup Logging)
        B --> RobotC(Initialize RobotContainer) --> initSub(Initialize Subsystems)
        Log --> Meta(Record MetaData)
        RobotC --> RegisterCmds(Register Auto & Drive Commands)
        RobotC --> SetupAuto(Setup AutoChooser)
        RobotC --> Bindings(Set Drive and Manip Controller Bindings)
        
        
    end
    subgraph Periodic 
        RobotC --> Periodic(Robot Periodic)
    end
    Bindings -->|Input Detected| doSomething(Run Corrosponding Commands)